{"status":"question","question":{"text":"Before I pin a stack, I want the ONE core thing this finance site does first. My recommendation: center it on tracking transactions — you log/import expenses and income and see where your money goes — since that's the beating heart every other personal-finance feature (budgets, reports, net worth) hangs off. Does that match what you picture, or is the primary job something else (e.g. budgeting, investment tracking, bill reminders)?","choices":["Tracking transactions (income/expenses)","Budgeting against categories","Investment / net-worth tracking","Bill / subscription reminders"],"recommended":"Tracking transactions (income/expenses)"},"prd":"# Mission: Personal finance website — foundation\n\n**Type:** feature\n**Goal:** (drafting — pending captain alignment)\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n- TBD\n**Out of Scope:**\n- TBD\n**Constraints:**\n- TBD\n"}

